@TimelyNotes.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5186

# Both read routes filter on a required half-open window of calendar dates: [searchFrom, searchTo).
# Plain dates, no time and no offset — the server has no timezone.
# Adjust the dates to sit around the day you run these on — the seed is anchored to today ± 3 days.
@searchFrom = 2026-08-27
@searchTo = 2026-08-30

### List the notes for the 1-hourly Schedule
GET {{TimelyNotes.API_HostAddress}}/api/schedules/s1/notes?searchFrom={{searchFrom}}&searchTo={{searchTo}}
Accept: application/json

### List the notes for the 3-hourly Schedule
GET {{TimelyNotes.API_HostAddress}}/api/schedules/s3/notes?searchFrom={{searchFrom}}&searchTo={{searchTo}}
Accept: application/json

### List the notes for the 6-hourly Schedule
GET {{TimelyNotes.API_HostAddress}}/api/schedules/s6/notes?searchFrom={{searchFrom}}&searchTo={{searchTo}}
Accept: application/json

### The previous window — half-open, so it shares no note with the one above
GET {{TimelyNotes.API_HostAddress}}/api/schedules/s1/notes?searchFrom=2026-08-24&searchTo={{searchFrom}}
Accept: application/json

### A window holding nothing — 200 with an empty list
GET {{TimelyNotes.API_HostAddress}}/api/schedules/s1/notes?searchFrom=2027-01-01&searchTo=2027-01-02
Accept: application/json

### An unknown Schedule — a 400 naming the parameter
GET {{TimelyNotes.API_HostAddress}}/api/schedules/s99/notes?searchFrom={{searchFrom}}&searchTo={{searchTo}}
Accept: application/json

### Too wide — 8 days is a 400
GET {{TimelyNotes.API_HostAddress}}/api/schedules/s1/notes?searchFrom=2026-08-27&searchTo=2026-09-04
Accept: application/json

### searchTo before searchFrom — a 400
GET {{TimelyNotes.API_HostAddress}}/api/schedules/s1/notes?searchFrom={{searchTo}}&searchTo={{searchFrom}}
Accept: application/json

### Missing searchTo — a 400
GET {{TimelyNotes.API_HostAddress}}/api/schedules/s1/notes?searchFrom={{searchFrom}}
Accept: application/json

### An instant rather than a date — a 400 from the binder
GET {{TimelyNotes.API_HostAddress}}/api/schedules/s1/notes?searchFrom=2026-08-27T00:00:00%2B01:00&searchTo={{searchTo}}
Accept: application/json

### Per-day note counts for a month grid — 42 days at most
GET {{TimelyNotes.API_HostAddress}}/api/schedules/s1/note-days?searchFrom=2026-08-31&searchTo=2026-10-05
Accept: application/json

### The same window for the 6-hourly Schedule
GET {{TimelyNotes.API_HostAddress}}/api/schedules/s6/note-days?searchFrom=2026-08-31&searchTo=2026-10-05
Accept: application/json

### Too wide — 43 days is a 400
GET {{TimelyNotes.API_HostAddress}}/api/schedules/s1/note-days?searchFrom=2026-08-31&searchTo=2026-10-13
Accept: application/json

###
